<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= title %> - E-Ticket IT Helpdesk</title>
  <!-- Bootstrap 5 CSS -->
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Bootstrap Icons -->
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- Custom CSS -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="d-flex flex-column min-vh-100">

  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <main class="container my-5">
    <div class="p-5 mb-4 bg-white rounded-3 shadow-sm border text-center">
      <div class="container-fluid py-3">
        <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold text-primary mb-3">
          <i class="bi bi-ticket-perforated me-2"></i>Sistem E-Ticket IT Helpdesk
        </h1>
        <p class="col-md-8 mx-auto fs-5 text-muted">
          Platform pelaporan masalah IT untuk mempermudah karyawan mengajukan tiket dan tim IT Helpdesk memproses serta memantau laporan.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-4 badge bg-success-subtle text-success fs-6 p-2 px-3 border border-success-subtle">
          <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill me-1"></i> Fondasi Repo & Server Siap (Tahap 00)
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title text-primary"><i class="bi bi-person me-2"></i>Karyawan</h5>
            <p class="card-text text-muted">Kirim tiket kendala perangkat, jaringan, atau aplikasi dengan mudah dan pantau perkembangannya.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title text-success"><i class="bi bi-tools me-2"></i>IT Helpdesk</h5>
            <p class="card-text text-muted">Kelola antrean tiket, perbarui status penanganan, dan berikan solusi secara terstruktur.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <div class="card h-100 shadow-sm border-0">
          <div class="card-body">
            <h5 class="card-title text-dark"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart-line me-2"></i>Laporan & Analitik</h5>
            <p class="card-text text-muted">Visualisasi performa penanganan tiket dan kategori masalah paling sering menggunakan Chart.js.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>

  <!-- Bootstrap 5 JS Bundle -->
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
  <!-- Custom JS -->
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>

